  "description": "Find the length of the longest chain of words where each word is a predecessor of the next by adding exactly one letter.",
  "target": 4,
  "pseudocode": "words.sort((a,b) => a.length - b.length);\nconst dp = new Map();\nlet maxChain = 1;\nfor (const word of words) {\n  dp.set(word, 1);\n  for (let i = 0; i < word.length; i++) {\n    const prev = word.slice(0, i) + word.slice(i + 1);\n    if (dp.has(prev)) {\n      dp.set(word, Math.max(dp.get(word), dp.get(prev) + 1));\n    }\n  }\n  maxChain = Math.max(maxChain, dp.get(word));\n}",
